Z||000000||FAXKID||09-29-1999||11:38 PM||||Need help on getting into the turn signal switch.Is there an easy way to remove the cover,or does the steering wheel have to come off?||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||09-29-1999||11:41 PM||||yes, the steering wheel has to come off. You need a puller for it. Do Not strike the shaft! you'll likely wreck the column if you do.<P>you also have to take off the lock plate under it. A special tool is needed for that. You can make the tool or buy it.||||reg||1
